{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9067b92884ab95fd9ca114a12be7a3cbc3e6039efdcc2d7f2dc5a3c9c587ed65","ja":"ラストって、難しそうですよね……。\nなにかありさにお手伝いできることありませんか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"86db6bd83eb56d40b6c672b44b6e13ccd6082ff44c172a09decbd52a62fcf65c","ja":"ありがとう。けど、ふたりはちゃんと\n自分のパートを書きあげたのだから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6638916a9d0ff3311f901fd48a5e38a15ef29954139faca84759ec1375f21e66","ja":"ここからは、私が自分で頑張らないと。\nみんなの努力を無駄にしないためにも。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9094c4ad25c5c7dcbddf77736b9bbf4481efa86dd3566b4df506a57b52de49dc","ja":"そう？　でも……なんだか気になるな～。\n千早ちゃん、小説書くの、ちゃんと楽しんでる？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e","ja":"えっ……？","zh":"咦……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5059a837431bde2259af3b655cd55ebb23a60e0b0166eac0aa7c2c3efe8b4829","ja":"あのね、私は小説書くとき、とってもワクワク\nしたんだ。何を書こうかなってドキドキもして！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4d8bd6025203bf1bb5ef849be36d527bec736d42c0fc15bc06d274321ab2c9ec","ja":"だからね、千早ちゃんもすっごく楽しい気持ちで\n小説を書くことができたら、素敵だろうな～って♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d3f9382255df4820b2ba55be56188256c368bc32b524e7b9c88632f426c22dd2","ja":"そうですね！　ありさも自分の欲ぼ……\nいえ、願いを込めて楽しく書かせてもらいましたから！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2fa5321a10a01b5b586cebf61fc9bf7da6e7281597655bf21515f4319b8566bf","ja":"その結果、物語に関係ない『同じピアノ教室に通う\nアイドルちゃん』を登場させてしまいましたが！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"73ea4c6d9e4df526edef69f86d8338229d5feff58e0634ed88216e13be10ee59","ja":"私も、こうだったら面白いかな～って気持ちだけで\n主人公ちゃんに旅をさせちゃったな♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f1c76dc190fa24f41d5f1f29f7ba955996e4ea4048507c0f3a19e7f61dee7b59","ja":"けど、それは物語を盛り上げる部分だから\nできることで、私はちゃんと物語をまとめないと。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5422f114931f0e198d2e09ce61265468fdb4a0a0d59c71337f23af12812a22b5","ja":"う～ん……キレイにまとめなくても\nいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c4da30ab7e4a31771c34aaae3fcebca6a42b8adaab32060e85f73920eff92627","ja":"……！？　そう、なんでしょうか……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"83a0a3719b0536777fb161efd5940a379bb219aa8da9db2610ca9b405b04a53a","ja":"はい、こういうのはなんだってアリですよ、きっと！\n「自由に小説を書いてみよう」って企画ですし！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b6b944c58e9cde81cc40b58185a9a5766030927e2373b15ddf3317b7952cf2d0","ja":"だからありさは、千早ちゃんが自由に書いた物語を\n読めるのを楽しみに待ってます！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
